Question("sign-meaning-C5", "sign-C5", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("No motorcycles or class I mopeds", "C5 · No motorcycles or class I mopeds. Motorcycles and class I mopeds are prohibited. Do not treat this as the same prohibition as C4, which concerns motor-driven vehicles with more than two wheels.", ""), Option("Shared pedestrian and cycle path", "D6 · Shared pedestrian and cycle path. Pedestrians and cyclists share the path. Read any panel excluding class II mopeds.", ""), Option("Falling rocks", "A12 · Falling rocks. Falling rocks may occur, and rocks from a fall may lie on the road. Look for debris and leave enough space to respond.", ""), Option("No heavy lorries", "C7 · No heavy lorries. Traffic with heavy lorries is prohibited. Identify the vehicle class rather than assuming that every vehicle carrying goods is a heavy lorry.", "")), 0, "Motorcycles and class I mopeds are prohibited. Do not treat this as the same prohibition as C4, which concerns motor-driven vehicles with more than two wheels.", 329, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-trafik-med-motorcykel-och-moped-klass-i/", "curriculum/h1-c5.png", rewrite9E3Node000345()),
