Question("sign-meaning-C6", "sign-C6", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Restriction on motor vehicles towing trailers", "C6 · Restriction on motor vehicles towing trailers. The basic prohibition excludes semi-trailers and centre-axle trailers (släpkärror). A panel may extend it to those types or specify a trailer-weight threshold.", ""), Option("Commercial area", "G10 · Commercial area. Identifies an area for trade or shopping. Use the symbol to locate the destination; check entry and parking rules separately.", ""), Option("Distance board", "F13 · Distance board. Distances to the listed destinations are shown in whole kilometres.", ""), Option("Pedestrian crossing marking", "M15 · Pedestrian crossing marking. This marks the pedestrian crossing associated with B3. Identify whether it is signal-controlled before applying the crossing duties.", "")), 0, "The basic prohibition excludes semi-trailers and centre-axle trailers (släpkärror). A panel may extend it to those types or specify a trailer-weight threshold.", 329, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-trafik-med-motordrivet-fordon-med-tillkopplad-slapvagn/", "curriculum/cf07c6b7450fd85b-c6-1.png", rewrite9E3Node000445()),
