Question("sign-meaning-C11", "sign-C11", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("No class II mopeds", "C11 · No class II mopeds. Class II mopeds are prohibited. If the prohibition also covers class I mopeds, a supplementary panel states this.", ""), Option("Lane or carriageway for scheduled public transport and other permitted users", "D10 · Lane or carriageway for scheduled public transport and other permitted users. Do not assume an ordinary car may enter. Certain other users are permitted by the traffic rules, and panels can specify additional permissions or restrictions.", ""), Option("Stop for the stated purpose", "C34 · Stop for the stated purpose. Stop for the reason written below the horizontal bar. When the sign is placed before a traffic signal, a vehicle passing that signal must stop at red, at the stop line or, if there is none, at the sign.", ""), Option("Accessible parking marking", "M33 · Accessible parking marking. This marks a space reserved for people with mobility impairments. Check the applicable permit conditions.", "")), 0, "Class II mopeds are prohibited. If the prohibition also covers class I mopeds, a supplementary panel states this.", 329, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-trafik-med-moped-klass-ii/", "curriculum/h1-c11.png", rewrite9E3Node000945()),
