Question("sign-meaning-C13", "sign-C13", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("No off-road motor vehicles or off-road trailers", "C13 · No off-road motor vehicles or off-road trailers. Off-road motor vehicles and off-road trailers are prohibited. If off-road wagons are exempt from the prohibition, this is stated on a supplementary panel.", ""), Option("Bus station", "G7 · Bus station. This identifies a bus station serving as a connection point for several routes.", ""), Option("Zone ends", "E21 · Zone ends. The zone restriction or permission shown by the matching E20 sign ends.", ""), Option("Pedestrian crossing", "B3 · Pedestrian crossing. This identifies a pedestrian crossing. At an uncontrolled crossing, drivers yield to people who have entered or are about to enter.", "")), 0, "Off-road motor vehicles and off-road trailers are prohibited. If off-road wagons are exempt from the prohibition, this is stated on a supplementary panel.", 330, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-trafik-med-terrangmotorfordon-och-terrangslap/", "curriculum/h1-c13.png", rewrite9E3Node001148()),
