Question("sign-meaning-C22", "sign-C22", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Road bearing-capacity class", "C22 · Road bearing-capacity class. The displayed class identifies the road's bearing-capacity regime. Check the applicable axle and weight limits for your vehicle.", ""), Option("Open 24 hours a day", "T25 · Open 24 hours a day. Indicates that a refreshments facility or restaurant is open round the clock. The panel is used below H5 or H6 and qualifies that facility information.", ""), Option("Local loop", "F30 · Local loop. Indicates a ring road or a comparable local loop. A designation may be added; use it to follow the indicated route.", ""), Option("Zone begins", "E20 · Zone begins. The inserted restrictions or permissions apply throughout the signed area. Locally signed exceptions do not automatically end the wider zone rule.", "")), 0, "The displayed class identifies the road's bearing-capacity regime. Check the applicable axle and weight limits for your vehicle.", 330, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/barighetsklass/", "curriculum/ASSET-743da904a0ea5a00.png", rewrite9E3Node002072()),
