Question("sign-meaning-C25", "sign-C25", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Prohibited turn", "C25 · Prohibited turn. The depicted turn is prohibited at the relevant junction. A length panel can extend the restriction across several junctions.", ""), Option("Joining road with its own lane", "F20 · Joining road with its own lane. The joining road continues in a separate lane. Read the actual lane layout and markings.", ""), Option("Advance destination table", "F3 · Advance destination table. Read the listed directions and approach distance before the junction or roundabout.", ""), Option("Junction with yielding side roads", "A29 · Junction with yielding side roads. Traffic joining from the connecting roads must yield or stop. Match the diagram to the actual junction; it does not remove your duty of care.", "")), 0, "The depicted turn is prohibited at the relevant junction. A length panel can extend the restriction across several junctions.", 331, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-svang-i-korsning/", "curriculum/ASSET-79867121aaea7f5c.png", rewrite9E3Node002383()),
