Question("sign-meaning-C27", "sign-C27", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("No overtaking", "C27 · No overtaking. Do not overtake motor vehicles other than two-wheeled mopeds and motorcycles without sidecars. Other overtaking safety rules still apply; the sign restriction continues to C28.", ""), Option("Vehicle charging station", "H27 · Vehicle charging station. This identifies a facility for externally charging an electrically powered vehicle.", ""), Option("Give way", "B1 · Give way. Yield to vehicles on the crossing road or route. With a distance or stop-ahead panel, this can instead be advance information.", ""), Option("Reinforcement of a stopping or parking restriction", "M23 · Reinforcement of a stopping or parking restriction. This yellow marking reinforces the applicable M21 or M22 restriction. Identify which prohibition applies.", "")), 0, "Do not overtake motor vehicles other than two-wheeled mopeds and motorcycles without sidecars. Other overtaking safety rules still apply; the sign restriction continues to C28.", 331, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-omkorning/", "curriculum/2394caff16b1948f-c27-1.png", rewrite9E4Node000046()),
