Question("sign-meaning-C28", "sign-C28", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("End of overtaking prohibition", "C28 · End of overtaking prohibition. The prohibition introduced by C27 ends. General overtaking restrictions still apply.", ""), Option("Lane arrows", "M19 · Lane arrows. Choose the appropriate lane for the next junction. Where a continuous line bounds the lane, follow its arrow directions, subject to the specified reserved-lane exception.", ""), Option("Chair lift", "H18 · Chair lift. Identifies a lift facility with chairs or similar seating. Use it as facility information.", ""), Option("Joining road with acceleration lane", "F19 · Joining road with acceleration lane. The diagram shows a joining road with an acceleration lane. It does not give a joining driver an unconditional right to enter.", "")), 0, "The prohibition introduced by C27 ends. General overtaking restrictions still apply.", 331, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/slut-pa-forbud-mot-omkorning/", "curriculum/370a3ba1e01be745-c28-1.png", rewrite9E4Node000150()),
