Question("sign-meaning-C29", "sign-C29", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("No overtaking with a heavy lorry", "C29 · No overtaking with a heavy lorry. A heavy lorry must not overtake other motor-driven vehicles except two-wheeled mopeds and two-wheeled motorcycles without sidecars. The prohibition applies along the road until C30 ends it.", ""), Option("Tunnel-category panel", "T23 · Tunnel-category panel. Used below C9 for vehicles carrying the specified dangerous-goods loads. The letter B, C, D or E states the tunnel category. Times may be given according to the provisions for T6.", ""), Option("Camp site", "H11 · Camp site. Identifies a facility providing pitches for both tents and vehicles with living accommodation. Check the site conditions and availability.", ""), Option("Accident ahead", "A41 · Accident ahead. Prepare for an accident-related hazard and respond to the traffic conditions and further instructions.", "")), 0, "A heavy lorry must not overtake other motor-driven vehicles except two-wheeled mopeds and two-wheeled motorcycles without sidecars. The prohibition applies along the road until C30 ends it.", 331, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/forbud-mot-omkorning-med-tung-lastbil/", "curriculum/h1-c29.png", rewrite9E4Node000250()),
