Question("sign-meaning-C30", "sign-C30", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("End of heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition", "C30 · End of heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition. The heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition indicated by C29 ends here. Continue to apply the ordinary overtaking rules and check that any manoeuvre is safe and permitted.", ""), Option("One-way traffic", "E16 · One-way traffic. Vehicle traffic travels only in the arrow's direction on this road.", ""), Option("Passing place", "E18 · Passing place. This identifies a place for vehicles to pass each other on a narrow road.", ""), Option("Exit direction sign", "F7 · Exit direction sign. The exit begins at this sign. Do not make a late unsafe lane change to reach it.", "")), 0, "The heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition indicated by C29 ends here. Continue to apply the ordinary overtaking rules and check that any manoeuvre is safe and permitted.", 331, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/slut-pa-forbud-mot-omkorning-med-tung-lastbil/", "curriculum/h1-c30.png", rewrite9E4Node000349()),
