Question("sign-meaning-C31", "sign-C31", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Maximum speed", "C31 · Maximum speed. Do not exceed the displayed speed in km/h. A junction alone does not necessarily end the limit, and conditions may require a lower speed.", ""), Option("Exit direction sign", "F7 · Exit direction sign. The exit begins at this sign. Do not make a late unsafe lane change to reach it.", ""), Option("Speed obstacle", "M17 · Speed obstacle. The marking indicates a speed obstacle such as a hump, depression or similar feature. Observe the road surface and adjust speed before reaching it.", ""), Option("Junction with right-hand priority", "A28 · Junction with right-hand priority. The junction ahead is governed by the right-hand priority rule. Do not assume the broader road has priority.", "")), 0, "Do not exceed the displayed speed in km/h. A junction alone does not necessarily end the limit, and conditions may require a lower speed.", 331, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/forbudsmarken/hastighetsbegransning/", "curriculum/ASSET-80fd662ab6326f9d.png", rewrite9E4Node000451()),
