Question("sign-meaning-D10", "sign-D10", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Lane or carriageway for scheduled public transport and other permitted users", "D10 · Lane or carriageway for scheduled public transport and other permitted users. Do not assume an ordinary car may enter. Certain other users are permitted by the traffic rules, and panels can specify additional permissions or restrictions.", ""), Option("Lane reduction", "F17 · Lane reduction. The number of lanes decreases. Use the diagram to plan a safe change early.", ""), Option("Parking garage", "F28 · Parking garage. Directs you to a parking garage. Its name may be included, and nearby information may state whether spaces are available or the garage is full. Check the parking conditions on arrival.", ""), Option("End of heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition", "C30 · End of heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition. The heavy-lorry overtaking prohibition indicated by C29 ends here. Continue to apply the ordinary overtaking rules and check that any manoeuvre is safe and permitted.", "")), 0, "Do not assume an ordinary car may enter. Certain other users are permitted by the traffic rules, and panels can specify additional permissions or restrictions.", 333, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/pabudsmarken/pabjudet-korfalt-eller-korbana-for-fordon-i-linjetrafik-mfl/", "curriculum/ASSET-f873691eab39f1b6.png", rewrite9E5Node000454()),
