Question("sign-meaning-D11", "sign-D11", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("End of designated path or lane", "D11 · End of designated path or lane. The designation shown by the crossed symbol ends. The symbol must match the preceding path or lane designation.", ""), Option("No motor vehicles except class II mopeds", "C3 · No motor vehicles except class II mopeds. Motor vehicles are prohibited, with class II mopeds excluded unless a panel also prohibits them.", ""), Option("Free parking ticket required", "T20 · Free parking ticket required. Parking is free, but a parking ticket must be used. Do not interpret the ticket symbol as a fee requirement.", ""), Option("Open 24 hours a day", "T25 · Open 24 hours a day. Indicates that a refreshments facility or restaurant is open round the clock. The panel is used below H5 or H6 and qualifies that facility information.", "")), 0, "The designation shown by the crossed symbol ends. The symbol must match the preceding path or lane designation.", 333, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/pabudsmarken/slut-pa-pabjuden-bana-korfalt-vag-eller-led/", "curriculum/ASSET-0e5fbc9f1b6d5662.png", rewrite9E5Node000558()),
