Question("sign-meaning-E24", "sign-E24", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Automatic traffic surveillance", "E24 · Automatic traffic surveillance. Automatic camera or equivalent monitoring may take place here to enforce traffic rules, taxation or charges; personal data may be recorded under the applicable rules. If it concerns a longer road section, T1 states its length and the sign is repeated at suitable intervals.", ""), Option("Advance temporary diversion", "F23 · Advance temporary diversion. The ordinary road is temporarily closed. The diagram shows the diversion route.", ""), Option("End of motorway", "E2 · End of motorway. The motorway ends here or at the distance indicated. Read the regime that follows.", ""), Option("Direction sign", "F5 · Direction sign. The sign points to a destination at a junction. Any stated distance is in whole kilometres.", "")), 0, "Automatic camera or equivalent monitoring may take place here to enforce traffic rules, taxation or charges; personal data may be recorded under the applicable rules. If it concerns a longer road section, T1 states its length and the sign is repeated at suitable intervals.", 335, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/anvisningsmarken/automatisk-trafikovervakning/", "curriculum/h1-e24.png", rewrite9E6Node000559()),
