Question("sign-meaning-M7", "sign-M7", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Reversible-lane boundary", "M7 · Reversible-lane boundary. The lane can carry traffic in different directions at different times. Its current control determines whether you may use it.", ""), Option("Information point", "H1 · Information point. Information is available at the indicated place. Nearby text may identify the type of information.", ""), Option("Sight of national interest", "H22 · Sight of national interest. Identifies a sight of national interest. Information next to the sign states the nature of the sight.", ""), Option("No motorcycles or class I mopeds", "C5 · No motorcycles or class I mopeds. Motorcycles and class I mopeds are prohibited. Do not treat this as the same prohibition as C4, which concerns motor-driven vehicles with more than two wheels.", "")), 0, "The lane can carry traffic in different directions at different times. Its current control determines whether you may use it.", 350, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/vagmarkeringar/reversibelt-korfalt/", "curriculum/ASSET-8077c3ed86a35325.png", rewrite9E10Node000664()),
