Question("sign-meaning-M8", "sign-M8", Category.RULES, "Which description identifies this illustrated Swedish sign, symbol or road marking?", listOf(Option("Continuous line", "M8 · Continuous line. Crossing restrictions apply according to the type of continuous line and the traffic rules. Do not invent an exception merely because the road appears clear.", ""), Option("Gas for vehicle propulsion", "H4 · Gas for vehicle propulsion. Identifies a facility supplying vehicle gas. The abbreviation states the gas type; CNG means compressed natural gas. Check the fuel type required by your vehicle.", ""), Option("Lane temporarily ends", "F25 · Lane temporarily ends. A lane is temporarily closed and another lane in your direction is available. Prepare to move safely as indicated.", ""), Option("World Heritage site", "I4 · World Heritage site. This identifies a site designated as World Heritage by UNESCO.", "")), 0, "Crossing restrictions apply according to the type of continuous line and the traffic rules. Do not invent an exception merely because the road appears clear.", 350, "https://www.transportstyrelsen.se/sv/vagtrafik/trafikregler-och-vagmarken/vagmarken/vagmarkeringar/heldragen-linje/", "curriculum/ASSET-f977ba39e60a5ef3.png", rewrite9E10Node000768()),
